          text: `${plural(r.count, "renewal charge")} for ${plural(r.users, "customer")} ${r.count === 1 ? "was" : "were"} declined${r.reasons[0] ? ` — mostly "${r.reasons[0].label}"` : ""}.`,
          why: "An existing customer whose renewal fails is revenue already earned once; losing them to a card problem is avoidable churn.",
