              text: `${d.device} is ${fmtP(vs)} of visitors but ${fmtP(ps)} of new paying signups (${fmtN(d.payers)} of ${fmtN(pay)}).`,
              why: "A big share of traffic that almost never buys is either the wrong audience or a checkout that doesn't work well on that device.",
              action: "Offer 'email me this configuration' or 'continue on desktop' at the Payment step, and test checkout on that device.",
              impactCents: 0,
