            text: `${plural(s.sessionsShown, "wizard session")} saw a sold-out region${s.picks[0] ? `, most often ${s.picks[0].region}` : ""}.`,
            why: "A sold-out region in front of a buyer is a lost order unless the next-nearest region is offered right there.",
            action: "Add capacity in that region or pre-select the nearest open one with a one-line explanation.",
            impactCents: Math.round(s.sessionsShown * ctx.cust * 0.1),
