          why: "QA accounts inflate signups and provisioning failures on every page that trusts the flag.",
          action: "Flag them excludeFromRevenue in the user admin (one QA account produced 35 of 49 provisioning errors in one week).",
          impactCents: 0,
          impactCustomers: 0,
          drill: drill(ctx, "/admin/users?q=.test", "Find them"),
        }),
      ];
